<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>林一 · 作品集</title>
    <!-- Font Awesome 6 (免费图标库) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: #fafafc;
            color: #1e1e2a;
            line-height: 1.5;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        /* 导航栏 */
        nav {
            padding: 24px 0 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaef;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 32px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #2c2c3a;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        /* 按钮 */
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            color: #1e1e2a;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            background: rgba(59,130,246,0.05);
        }

        /* 头部区域 */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .hero-content {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .hero-content .badge {
            background: #eef2ff;
            color: #2563eb;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .hero-content .highlight {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .hero-content p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-image {
            flex: 0.8;
            background: #e4e4e9;
            border-radius: 32px;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0e7ff 0%, #f3e8ff 100%);
        }

        /* 作品集网格 */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            border: 1px solid #edeef2;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 30px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .project-img {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .project-info {
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .project-info h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .project-info p {
            color: #5b6b8c;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .tags span {
            background: #f0f2f5;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .project-link {
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        /* 关于区域 */
        .about {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            margin-bottom: 80px;
            border: 1px solid #eef2ff;
        }

        .about h2 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 24px 0 20px;
        }

        .skills span {
            background: #eef2ff;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        /* 联系区 */
        .contact {
            text-align: center;
            background: #1e1e2a;
            color: white;
            padding: 64px 24px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .contact-email {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 32px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .social-links a {
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .social-links a:hover {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px 0 48px;
            color: #6c6e7c;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero {
                flex-direction: column-reverse;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .hero-content p {
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
            }
            .hero-actions {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .nav-links {
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
    <div class="container">
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#work">作品</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">关于</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">联系</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</nav>

<main>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 英雄区 -->
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <div class="badge">✨ 开放合作</div>
                <h1>林一 <span class="highlight">设计·开发</span></h1>
                <p>专注于界面与用户体验，用代码让创意落地。3年全栈经验，热爱简洁优雅的数字产品。</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="#work" class="btn">查看作品</a>
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">联系我</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image">
                <i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 作品集区域 -->
        <h2 id="work" class="section-title">精选项目</h2>
        <div class="projects-grid">
            <!-- 卡片 1 -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-img">
                    <i class="fas fa-cloud-moon"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h3>智能天气应用</h3>
                    <p>实时天气 + 未来7日预测，支持深色模式与桌面小组件。</p>
                    <div class="tags">
                        <span>React</span><span>Tailwind</span><span>API</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="project-link">了解更多 →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 卡片 2 -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-img">
                    <i class="fas fa-store"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h3>极简电商</h3>
                    <p>前端购物车、商品筛选与支付模拟，响应式布局。</p>
                    <div class="tags">
                        <span>Vue</span><span>Pinia</span><span>Vite</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="project-link">了解更多 →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 卡片 3 -->
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="project-img">
                    <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="project-info">
                    <h3>团队协作仪表盘</h3>
                    <p>数据可视化、任务管理面板，适配移动端。</p>
                    <div class="tags">
                        <span>Next.js</span><span>Chart.js</span><span>Prisma</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="project-link">了解更多 →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 关于 + 技能 -->
        <div id="about" class="about">
            <h2>👋 关于我</h2>
            <p>我是林一，一名全栈设计师与开发者。我喜欢将复杂的想法转化为干净、直观的界面。从概念到上线，我关注每一个细节。</p>
            <div class="skills">
                <span>React</span><span>Vue</span><span>Python</span><span>Figma</span>
                <span>Tailwind</span><span>Node.js</span><span>Git</span>
            </div>
            <p>📌 现居杭州 · 自由职业 & 开源爱好者</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 联系区 (免费方案: 展示邮箱+社交, 无需后端) -->
        <div id="contact" class="contact">
            <h2>📬 开始合作</h2>
            <p>无论是项目咨询，还是单纯打个招呼，都欢迎！</p>
            <div class="contact-email">
                <i class="far fa-envelope"></i>  hi@linyi.me
            </div>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="#" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-github"></i></a>
                <a href="#" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a>
                <a href="#" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
                <a href="#" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 32px; font-size: 0.85rem;">✨ 点击邮箱即可复制，或直接发送邮件</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<footer>
    <div class="container">
        <p>© 2025 林一 · 设计并开发 | 保持好奇，持续创造</p>
    </div>
</footer>

<script>
    // 让邮箱一键复制（提升用户体验）
    const emailDiv = document.querySelector('.contact-email');
    if(emailDiv) {
        emailDiv.style.cursor = 'pointer';
        emailDiv.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const email = emailDiv.innerText.replace(/[^\w@.-]/g, ''); // 清理图标字符
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(email).then(() => {
                const originalText = emailDiv.innerHTML;
                emailDiv.innerHTML = '✅ 已复制邮箱！';
                setTimeout(() => {
                    emailDiv.innerHTML = originalText;
                }, 2000);
            }).catch(() => {
                alert('手动复制: ' + email);
            });
        });
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
